{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach, pick up and check its properties. If destination is reached, move to it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
